      "content": "That's a pretty strong stance. You're basically saying that regardless of the immediate human cost or the risk of an economic recession, the transition is the only viable path. If a government's primary duty is to protect its citizens' welfare, how can they justify a policy that you've just labeled as \"not fiscally responsible\" for the very people living through it right now?",
